{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>the fifth time</b><br>התאנה. The name of the tree." "חנטה. From ויחנטו הרופאים, a term of preparing." "פגיה. Unripe fruit, and similarly from the language of [the Aramaic translator] for פג." "סמדר. When the blossom falls and the clusters separate and the grapes become visible, it is called סמדר." "<b>the third time</b><br>התאנה. To take first-fruits from it." "(ו)הגפנים. To pour wine."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:44:02.288906319Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}